cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these skills, or the method they carry, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "SAFA Foresight Skills"
abstract: "Nine Claude skills that carry the participatory foresight method of Ariella Helfgott and SA Futures Agency: horizon scanning, critical uncertainties, end states, a compatibility matrix, morphological analysis, scenario families, scenario set selection, scenario building, a shared vision and first priorities. The method is the authors' own work, shared for public benefit."
